    "premise": "Zarkatraz is chasing a single real piece of Órikal - the barely-understood mineral said to hold an old power of manifestation. Traders passing through Puente Continental have taken to calling it 'la Lágrima de Balahm' (the Balahm Teardrop); he's heard, secondhand and unconfirmed, that it's already changed hands twice and that it's said to come from somewhere in his own home desert. He means to be the one who finally holds it and keeps it - so that when he's gone, it passes to whoever in his family carries the trade forward next.",
